      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't know if a small anchor is enough. it feels like even those things are just more noise to him. the more i write him, the more i realize that maybe there isn't a \"thread\" to hold onto. it feels more like he's just... done. like he's finished the chapter and there's nothing left to write about. it's hard to make it feel authentic when everything feels so pointless. even for me, looking at him, it just feels like everything is so heavy and pointless.",
